# Brunel (2000) balanced E/I network (miniature, Studio-verifiable)
# Dynamics verification — not a classifier. Poisson drive via Deploy stimulus.
# Post-compile: apply_brunel_weights() in neurocnl.experiments.brunel_dynamics.

Define a network named brunel_ei with timestep 0.001.
Define an input port named external with shape (20,).
Define a LIF neuron named excitatory with time constant 0.02, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 1.0.
Define a LIF neuron named inhibitory with time constant 0.01, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 1.0.
Define a linear transformation named w_ext_e with weight matrix shape (40, 20) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 2000.
Define a linear transformation named w_e_e with weight matrix shape (40, 40) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 2001.
Define a linear transformation named w_e_i with weight matrix shape (10, 40) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 2002.
Define a linear transformation named w_i_e with weight matrix shape (40, 10) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 2003.
Define a linear transformation named w_i_i with weight matrix shape (10, 10) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 2004.
Define an output port named output with shape (40,).
external connects to w_ext_e.
w_ext_e connects to excitatory.
excitatory connects to w_e_e.
w_e_e connects to excitatory.
excitatory connects to w_e_i.
w_e_i connects to inhibitory.
inhibitory connects to w_i_e.
w_i_e connects to excitatory.
inhibitory connects to w_i_i.
w_i_i connects to inhibitory.
excitatory connects to output.
